vereign OSS model), being driven to GA via the **Foreman** multi-wave build orchestrator against Crucible-forged frozen plans in `plans/foreman/`.\n\n- **System version** â€” `v2.1` (gen-2 dynamic-context t2r brain + gen-1 harness), per `VERSIONING.md`.\n\nOne framing note worth flagging: the title you supplied (\"CLAUDE.md â€” Workspace Root\") is the *orientation doc's* heading, not the project's own name â€” the project's actual name is the **Agentic Sandbox / Ghost World Labs**."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6951,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20230,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20230},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ae030af-42aa-4ee0-bee1-aa008e34b99c","uuid":"79851a7a-5059-48a5-86e0-2bb38fe2de24","request_id":"req_011Cc2MyeU78F2QM8B8e7E5L"}
